{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13805","headline":"宿湖边山寺 · 顾况","name":"宿湖边山寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羣峰过雨涧淙淙，松下扉扃白鹤双。\n香透经窗笼桧栢，云生梵宇湿旛幢。\n蒲团僧定风过席，苇岸渔歌月堕江。\n谁悟此生同寂灭，老禅慧力得心降。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13805.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13805","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}